{"about_the_game":"<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/724930/extras/0649cadbaf8f184c96d68dbc202eb3a1.avif?t=1702182550\" width=610 height=156 /></span><br><br>Last Chickenburg is an action-packed strategy based sandbox rpg, in which you will take control of a member of the House of Chicken in order to take back Chickenburg from the Chickenburg Baron. Fight to build your base, gather resources and take back the land that is rightfully yours from the humans who wish to eradicate and enslave you.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/724930/extras/c3b827fd52a282cf55009982caa5ea71.poster.avif?t=1702182550\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/724930/extras/c3b827fd52a282cf55009982caa5ea71.webm?t=1702182550\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/724930/extras/c3b827fd52a282cf55009982caa5ea71.mp4?t=1702182550\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/724930/extras/ff196fc4f01fc201091effb16655eb84.webp?t=1702182550\" width=600 height=55 /></span><br><br>Last Chickenburg has a simple yet direct combat system appropriate for players of all skill levels. Select suitable armor type and weapons for each combat situation carefully to ensure victory against the enemies. Don\u2019t forget to rest up before you go!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/724930/extras/929aa72251e7bbd15ac9de5f073e6e72.poster.avif?t=1702182550\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.s